#X obj 205 78 cnv 1 560 135 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -257983 -1 0;
#X text 215 83 Simple formant/vocal synthesizer based on a source/filter
model. The source is just a periodic impulse and the "filter" is a
bank of FOF filters.;
#X text 215 138 Formant parameters are linearly interpolated allowing
to go smoothly from one vowel to another. Voice type can be selected
but must correspond to the frequency range of the synthesized voice
to be realistic.;
